From 276481d94132f1d5a738a9ae9c324b8eeee5a400 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:52:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Reaper-native UI: the last stock pages replaced, the stock UI
 removed at install; colour-blind mode; dictionary prune

- New kit pages: Reaper_Printer.asp, Reaper_TimeMachine.asp (stage 1), Reaper_Speed.asp, Reaper_OpMode.asp
  (stage 1c), Reaper_AiMesh.asp with the LED scheduler host aimesh/aimesh_led_sched.html (stage 2), Reaper_Network.asp
  with reaper/network_portal.json (stage 3). Add node is a dialog of the AiMesh page (stage 4a); when Connect had to
  switch WPS on for a Wi-Fi node, a watcher switches it off again 60 s after the node is online, or after 10 minutes.
- Stage 4b: the sign-in, password, error, block, node-message and sign-out pages and the six status pages load no
  stock script (own sign-in exchange, chpass, MD5 as the stock md5.js).
- Stage 5 (REAPER-CUT8): www/Makefile removes 391 stock files nothing kept loads, at install (the sources stay;
  REAPER-CUT8-STOCK). Kept on purpose: QIS_wizard.htm + mobile/ (the mode flows), PrinterServer.asp and
  Advanced_TimeMachine.asp (an AiMesh node serves them), the pages closed libwebapi.so names (SDN/sdn.html,
  internet_speed.html and their chain), require/modules/menuTree.js and the small scripts add-on pages load. The
  shell's skin injector and the stock skin sheets are gone; Reaper_WiFiSetup.asp carries its own rules.
- Dictionary prune (REAPER-CUT8-DICT): the last install step, tools/reaper_dict_prune.py, drops the 176 keys in
  tools/reaper_dict_prune.txt (named only by files the install removes on every model) from the STAGED packs - a line
  deleted in a named pack, emptied in place in a renumbered pack (httpd reads those by line position) - and fails
  the install if a staged file still names a listed key. The source packs are unchanged.
- Colour-blind mode (REAPER-CBMODE): Administration > System > Accessibility switches reaper_cbmode; reaper/reaper_cb.css
  maps every Reaper colour through var(--cb-*) roles; the sign-in and status pages follow the switch.
- Earlier the same window (audit 2026-11-24, REAPER-GONE-B6CD): ten unreferenced stock pages unshipped
  (cmdRet_check.htm, detect_firmware.asp, multi_vts_rule.asp, result_of_get_changed_status_QIS.asp,
  wds_aplist_5g_2.asp, wlconn_apply.htm, DDNS_info.asp, SITE_info.asp, Advanced_WProxy_Content.asp, QoS_Stats.asp);
  AiMesh_Node_RbkFirmware.asp / AiMesh_Node_RevertFirmware.asp only where their option is off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
