+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+<meta charset="utf-8">
+<link rel="stylesheet" href="/reaper/reaper_cb.css"><script>/*REAPER-CBMODE*/if(<% nvram_get_js("reaper_cbmode"); %>==="1")document.documentElement.classList.add("cb");</script>
+<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
+<meta name="reaper-native" content="1">
+<title>REAPER &mdash; AiMesh</title>
+<!-- Reaper_AiMesh.asp - AiMesh (Reaper-native UI, cutover stage 2, 2026-11-25).
+     Replaces AiMesh.asp + aimesh/aimesh_topology.html + aimesh/aimesh_system_settings.html (+ the backhaul /
+     fronthaul fragments). The owner's rule for this page: keep the stock behaviour and function, in a Reaper
+     design and implementation. The inventory it is built from, with a file:line reference for every rule, is the
+     maintainer's private spec (native-wave/spec_aimesh.md); section numbers below (1.3, 8.7, W2 ...) are that
+     spec's.
+     Same backends as stock: GET /appGet.cgi hooks get_cfg_clientlist, get_clientlist,
+     get_clientlist_from_json_database, get_onboardingstatus; POST /applyapp.cgi (JSON, with the page token
+     http_id, which httpd requires) for every write - node settings are action_mode "config_changed" with a
+     config JSON and re_mac, handled by the mesh daemon; the traffic and port readings come from
+     get_port_status.cgi and the get_diag_*_traffic.cgi endpoints.
+     Owner decisions (2026-11-25): a click on a connected device opens Reaper's Devices page (no copy of the
+     stock device card); the LED schedule keeps the stock scheduler component until the final cutover stage;
+     Add node (cutover stage 4, 2026-11-26): the stock wizard's search / choose / pair steps run in a dialog of
+     this page, with the wizard's requests, order and timing (spec 1.7, 3.3); no window, no wizard bundle.
+     Not carried, with the reason: the node photo and icon swap (removed by Reaper before, 7.5 / 7.6); the iperf
+     tab, the central-optimisation strip and the Powerline master row (their feature flags are off on every
+     supported build: a build that sets one shows nothing new rather than something wrong); the form that
+     renames the Wi-Fi networks when Ethernet-only backhaul is turned on (stock shows it only on models without
+     MLO: the switch itself is drawn only on MLO builds here); the per-client icons; the 25-minute self-reload
+     (B14); the bundled marketing-name table (a member shows the name it reports).
+     Fixed on the way (stock bugs the spec lists): follow-up refreshes are timed from the reply, not the send
+     (B1); the bind Retry moves the device when the target is online, not when it is offline (B2); the unbind
+     question names the member the device is bound to (B3); the node-removed check reads fresh data (B19);
+     Ethernet-only backhaul reads "off" for an empty value on both tabs (B17). -->
+<link rel="stylesheet" href="/reaper/rp.css">
+<style>
+/* page-specific rules only; the Reaper look comes from /reaper/rp.css */
+.off{display:none!important}
+.msg{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--amber);display:none}
+.tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;margin:0 0 12px}
+.tabs button{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:8px;color:var(--bone-dim);padding:7px 14px;font-family:var(--hdr);font-weight:600;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer}
+.tabs button.on{color:var(--bone);border-color:rgba(var(--cb-ok-rgb,79,178,134),.55);background:rgba(var(--cb-ok-rgb,79,178,134),.08)}
+.topo{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(260px,380px) 1fr;gap:18px;align-items:stretch}
+@media (max-width:900px){.topo{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
+.acts{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px}
+/* the tree: one row per mesh member, indented by level; the bar on the left carries the uplink's quality */
+.tree{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;overflow-x:auto}
+.node{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:9px 11px;border:1px solid var(--line-soft);border-left:3px solid var(--steel);border-radius:10px;background:var(--raised);cursor:pointer;min-width:220px}
+.node:hover{border-color:var(--line2)}
+.node.sel{border-color:rgba(var(--cb-ok-rgb,79,178,134),.55)}
+.node.q-great{border-left-color:var(--jade)} .node.q-ok{border-left-color:var(--jade)} .node.q-weak{border-left-color:var(--amber)}
+.node.q-disc,.node.offline{border-left-color:var(--cb-alert,var(--crimson))}
+.node.offline{opacity:.7}
+.node .nm{min-width:0;flex:1 1 auto}
+.node .nm b{display:block;font-family:var(--hdr);font-weight:600;font-size:14px;color:var(--bone);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
+.node .nm span{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--bone-dim);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
+.node .ln{font-size:11px;color:var(--steel);text-align:right;flex:0 0 auto;line-height:1.5}
+.node .ln .cnt{color:var(--bone-dim)}
+.node .ln .cnt.bindnote{color:var(--amber)}
+.node .warnf{color:var(--amber);font-weight:700;margin-left:4px}
+.intro{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--bone-dim);line-height:1.6;margin-top:10px}
+.legend{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--steel);margin-top:10px;line-height:1.7}
+.legend i{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:6px;vertical-align:-1px}
+/* the selected member */
+.card h2 small{font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:400;font-size:12px;color:var(--steel);letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;margin-left:8px}
+.kv{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(120px,190px) 1fr;gap:6px 14px;font-size:13px;margin:6px 0 12px}
+.kv .k{color:var(--steel)} .kv .v{color:var(--bone);min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
+.kv select{min-width:170px;max-width:100%} .kv input[type=text]{width:220px;max-width:100%}
+.hintline{font-size:12px;color:var(--amber);margin-top:4px;min-height:0}
+.qual b{font-weight:600}
+.qual.q-great b,.qual.q-ok b{color:var(--jade)} .qual.q-weak b{color:var(--amber)} .qual.q-disc b{color:var(--cb-alert,var(--crimson))}
+.rssi{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--bone-dim);margin-left:10px}
+.fwnew{color:var(--amber);font-size:12px;margin-left:8px}
+.linkbtn{background:none;border:0;padding:0;color:var(--bone);text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer;font:inherit}
+.subs{display:flex;gap:6px;margin:4px 0 12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
+.subs button{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:999px;color:var(--bone-dim);padding:5px 12px;font-size:12.5px;cursor:pointer}
+.subs button.on{color:var(--bone);border-color:rgba(var(--cb-ok-rgb,79,178,134),.55)}
+.notice{border:1px solid rgba(var(--cb-warn-rgb,224,169,59),.4);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--bone-dim);line-height:1.5}
+.notice a{color:var(--bone)}
+.kv select,.kv input[type=text],.frow select{background:#000;border:1px solid var(--line-soft);border-radius:8px;color:var(--bone);padding:7px 9px;font:inherit;font-size:13px}
+.legend .lg{margin-right:14px;white-space:nowrap} .legend a{color:var(--bone)}
+/* clients */
+.clhead{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:6px}
+.cltitle{font-family:var(--hdr);font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--bone)}
+.clnum{font-size:12px;color:var(--steel)}
+.cllist{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
+.cl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft);flex-wrap:wrap}
+.cl:first-child{border-top:none}
+.cl.gone{opacity:.6}
+.clmain{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:1 1 300px;min-width:0;flex-wrap:wrap}
+.clmain b{font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--bone);overflow-wrap:anywhere}
+.clmain .mono{font-size:12px;color:var(--bone-dim)}
+.clmain.go{cursor:pointer} .clmain.go:hover b{text-decoration:underline}
+.clacts{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
+.clnote{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--amber);max-width:260px}
+/* network cards */
+.nsec{margin-bottom:14px}
+.nsec h3{font-family:var(--hdr);font-weight:600;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--bone-dim);margin:0 0 8px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline}
+.nsec h3.fold{cursor:pointer}
+.ngrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:10px}
+.ncard{border:1px solid var(--line-soft);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;background:var(--raised)}
+.nsec > .ncard{margin-bottom:10px}
+.ncard h4{font-family:var(--hdr);font-weight:600;font-size:13px;color:var(--bone);margin:0 0 6px}
+.ncard .kv{margin:0;grid-template-columns:minmax(90px,130px) 1fr;font-size:12.5px}
+.v.good{color:var(--jade)} .v.bad{color:var(--cb-alert,var(--crimson))} .v.warnc{color:var(--amber)}
+.ports .prow{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:6px}
+.port{display:inline-block;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:6px;padding:4px 9px;font-size:12px;color:var(--bone-dim)}
+.port.conn{border-color:var(--jade);color:var(--bone)} .port.warn{border-color:var(--amber);color:var(--amber)} .port.unplug{border-style:dashed;color:var(--steel)}
+.plegend{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px;opacity:.8}
+/* management rows */
+.subrows{padding-left:18px}
+.qmark{min-width:30px;padding-left:9px;padding-right:9px}
+.curval{font-size:13px;color:var(--bone)}
+.frow input[type=range]{width:180px}
+/* dialog */
+.adlg{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(4,4,6,.72);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:70;padding:16px}
+.abox2{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:12px;max-width:540px;width:100%;max-height:88vh;overflow-y:auto;padding:18px 20px}
+.abox2 h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-family:var(--hdr);font-size:16px;color:var(--bone)}
+.atxt p{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--bone-dim);line-height:1.55;overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:pre-line}
+.alink{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:13px} .alink a{color:var(--bone)}
+.aacts{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:10px;margin-top:6px}
+.abox2.busy .atxt,.abox2.busy .radlist{opacity:.55}
+.radlist{display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin:0 0 12px}
+.rad{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft);cursor:pointer;font-size:13px}
+.rad.gray{opacity:.5;cursor:default}
+.radtxt b{display:block;color:var(--bone);font-weight:600} .radtxt span{display:block;color:var(--bone-dim);font-size:12px}
+/* add a node */
+.anw p{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--bone-dim);line-height:1.55;overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:pre-line}
+.anw p.anh{font-family:var(--hdr);font-weight:600;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--bone)}
+.anw p.anwarn{color:var(--amber)}
+.anw p.anst{text-align:center}
+.anbody.anfail p:nth-child(2){color:var(--amber)}
+.anl{margin:0 0 12px;padding-left:20px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--bone-dim);line-height:1.6}
+.anrows{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin:0 0 12px}
+.anrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:100%;text-align:left;background:var(--raised);border:1px solid var(--line-soft);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 12px;cursor:pointer;font:inherit}
+.anrow:hover,.anrow:focus-visible{border-color:rgba(var(--cb-ok-rgb,79,178,134),.55)}
+.anrow .radtxt{flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
+.anrow .radtxt span,.andev span{font-family:var(--mono)}
+.anlk{font-size:12px;color:var(--bone-dim)}
+.anbars{display:inline-flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:2px;height:14px}
+.anbars i{display:block;width:4px;height:4px;background:var(--line2);border-radius:1px}
+.anbars i:nth-child(2){height:7px} .anbars i:nth-child(3){height:10px} .anbars i:nth-child(4){height:14px}
+.anbars.b1 i:nth-child(-n+1),.anbars.b2 i:nth-child(-n+2),.anbars.b3 i:nth-child(-n+3),.anbars.b4 i{background:var(--jade)}
+.andev{border:1px solid var(--line-soft);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;margin:0 0 12px;background:var(--raised)}
+.andev b{display:block;color:var(--bone);font-weight:600;font-size:14px;overflow-wrap:anywhere} .andev span{font-size:12px;color:var(--bone-dim)}
+.anspin{width:26px;height:26px;border:3px solid var(--line2);border-top-color:var(--jade);border-radius:50%;margin:6px auto 12px;animation:anspin 1s linear infinite}
+@keyframes anspin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
+@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.anspin{animation:none}}
+.anpct{text-align:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:20px;color:var(--bone);margin:0 0 8px}
+/* the stock LED scheduler draws itself in the top window; its host frame has nothing to show */
+.ledhost{position:absolute;width:0;height:0;border:0;visibility:hidden}
+</style>
